<div class="panel" id="menu"><div class="card">
  <div class="row"><div style="flex:1;min-width:260px">
    <h1>LANTERN WOODS</h1>
    <p class="sub">Grandpa Odell kept the lantern at Hollowpine for forty years. Last night it went out — and so did he.<br>When the sun sets, the <b>Gloam</b> comes out of the trees. Keep the campfire burning, find his journal, and bring the four <b>Sunstones</b> home to wake the Beacon.</p>
    <div class="btns"><button class="btn pri" id="bStory">▶ New story</button><button class="btn" id="bCont" hidden>⏵ Continue</button><button class="btn" id="bEndless">♾ Endless nights</button><button class="btn" id="bOnline">🌐 Play with friends</button></div>
    <div class="btns"><button class="btn" id="bKeys">⌨ Controls</button><button class="btn" id="bView">👁 View: third person</button><button class="btn" id="bLook">🧍 Edit my character</button><label class="btn" style="display:flex;gap:6px;align-items:center"><input type="checkbox" id="lowq"> Faster graphics</label></div>
  </div><div style="text-align:center"><canvas id="me" width="300" height="400"></canvas><div style="font-size:12px;opacity:.7;margin-top:4px">This is you — change it in Character Creator</div></div></div>
  <div id="keys" hidden style="margin-top:12px"><div class="keys"><div><b>WASD</b> move</div><div><b>Shift</b> run</div><div><b>X</b> drop (into the grinder at the bench)</div><div><b>V</b> first person / third person</div><div><b>Mouse</b> look (click to lock)</div><div><b>Space</b> jump</div><div><b>Click / J</b> hit · chop · mine</div><div><b>E</b> use · pick up · add wood</div><div><b>Q</b> eat</div><div><b>F</b> flashlight</div><div><b>L</b> lantern</div><div><b>C</b> craft (at the workbench)</div><div><b>G</b> place a light post</div><div><b>1–0</b> hotbar</div><div><b>Right-click</b> aim</div><div><b>R</b> reload</div><div><b>Click / J</b> use the held item</div><div><b>Tab</b> open the sack</div><div><b>M</b> journal &amp; map</div><div><b>Esc</b> pause</div></div><p style="opacity:.7;font-size:13px">Phone: left side of the screen = walk, right side = look, buttons on the right. A game controller works too.</p></div>
</div></div>
<div class="panel" id="pause" hidden><div class="card" style="max-width:420px;text-align:center"><h2>Paused</h2><div class="btns" style="justify-content:center"><button class="btn pri" id="bResume">Resume</button><button class="btn" id="bSave">Save &amp; quit</button></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="craft" hidden><div class="card"><h2>🛠 Workbench</h2><p class="sub" style="margin:0 0 10px">Drop anything into the grinder hopper on the end of the bench (X): junk turns into scrap, logs, stone, food and batteries go into the camp stock.</p><div class="recipes" id="recipes"></div><h2 style="margin-top:14px">⚙️ Grinder</h2><p class="sub" id="grindInfo" style="margin:0 0 10px"></p><div class="recipes" id="grecipes"></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn" data-close>Close (C)</button></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="sackp" hidden><div class="card"><h2 id="sackTitle">🎒 Sack</h2><div class="cap"><i id="sackCap"></i></div><div class="slots" id="slots"></div><div id="sackInfo" style="min-height:20px;opacity:.85"></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn" id="sDrop">Drop</button><button class="btn" id="sEat">Eat</button><button class="btn" id="sDropAll">Drop everything</button><button class="btn" data-close>Close (Tab)</button></div><p style="opacity:.65;font-size:13px">Unload logs, stone, food and batteries at the <b>camp pile</b>. Junk (bolts, pipes, tires, radios) goes in the <b>grinder on the workbench</b>.</p></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="journal" hidden><div class="card"><div class="tabs"><button data-t="pages" class="on">📖 Journal</button><button data-t="map">🗺 Map</button><button data-t="goals">⭐ Goals</button></div><div id="jbody"></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn" data-close>Close (Tab)</button></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="reader" hidden><div class="card" style="max-width:560px"><div class="page" id="ptext"></div><div class="btns"><button class="btn pri" data-close>Close</button></div></div></div>
<div class="panel" id="over" hidden><div class="card" style="text-align:center"><div id="story"></div><div class="btns" style="justify-content:center" id="overBtns"></div></div></div>

